{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.poster.avif?t=1758815270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.webm?t=1758815270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.mp4?t=1758815270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>In a surreal world of ruin and shadow,</strong></i><strong> <i>your only tools are mushrooms, movement, and your mind.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Mycubium</strong></i> is a serene yet challenging first-person puzzle adventure about growth, connection, and the quiet resilience of life. You play as an unknown being tasked with navigating a broken, otherworldly landscape\u2014one bridge, one spore, one glowing mushroom at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each color of mushroom grows a bridge in a specific direction. With careful placement and strategic use of the environment, you\u2019ll reconnect the forgotten paths of a once-vibrant world. As you explore deeper, new mechanics evolve: rotating platforms, diagonal bridges, teleportation, and more. Every level holds a hand-crafted set of puzzles that teach through play\u2014no hints, no hand-holding, just intuition and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/2d62d2ab0c6bb4da6eac39ed3a505db4.avif?t=1758815270\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Spatial Mushroom Puzzle Platforming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place mushrooms on white cubes to grow vibrant directional bridges. Solve puzzles using jumping, stacking, sticking, and color-aligned logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 <strong>A meditative narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Told through atmosphere, environment, and parable-like insights\u2014no dialogue, minimal exposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaa <strong>Exploration &amp; Secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple pathways, hidden collectibles, and platforming challenges. Use switches to open doors or trigger lasers to unlock new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f <strong>A Journey Through Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a full day/night cycle across four levels. Each stage represents a new hour in this world\u2019s slow reawakening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Minimalist soundscape and ambient score</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calming, immersive audio experience designed to support reflection and focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Handcrafted environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a ruined fragment of a lost world waiting to be reconnected through your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Nonlinear Solutions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many puzzles have more than one solution. Find your own approach using intuition, creativity, and physics-based exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow bridges. Explore the unknown. Choose what to leave behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/6979be2ffaba750373eebadac70509b9.avif?t=1758815270\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859270?t=1758815270","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/cba05b6aa4c48a4ac7419944013dae6b4007d441/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758815270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/5a0411a352c5fba7b8f0d19d64bbc870f76f8920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758815270","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/5a0411a352c5fba7b8f0d19d64bbc870f76f8920/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758815270","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3895790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.poster.avif?t=1758815270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.webm?t=1758815270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.mp4?t=1758815270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>In a surreal world of ruin and shadow,</strong></i><strong> <i>you