ger lasers to unlock new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f <strong>A Journey Through Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a full day/night cycle across four levels. Each stage represents a new hour in this world\u2019s slow reawakening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Minimalist soundscape and ambient score</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calming, immersive audio experience designed to support reflection and focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Handcrafted environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a ruined fragment of a lost world waiting to be reconnected through your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Nonlinear Solutions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many puzzles have more than one solution. Find your own approach using intuition, creativity, and physics-based exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow bridges. Explore the unknown. Choose what to leave behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/6979be2ffaba750373eebadac70509b9.avif?t=1758815270\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["SynHaptic Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/0f4f2594b13c75cf8f104d9da21a5af6d9908edc/header.jpg?t=1758815270","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended: